  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BPD Telcon A/S</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Telcon seeks to aid in the development of mobile telecom infrastructure in Indonesia. Their core business includes the full range of telecommunication services, from cradle-to-grave. Seeing as the mobile telecom market in Indonesia is underdeveloped both in terms of quality and reach, the business case for Telcon is significant. Telcon offers services within both planning and financing (including advisory services to public infrastructure regulation, planning and implementation) and advisory services for telecom providers. With a growing market and shortage of quality service suppliers the business case looks commercially viable. If operations are successful in Indonesia, Telcon is ready to implement in Myanmar, where the potential is similarly large.</narrative>
  </description>
